## Flags for the release VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here.

## No busy waiting in idle schedulers (normal, dirty CPU, dirty IO): a home server
## that mostly waits on devices should not spin cores (issue #158).
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
